ttbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/MetricsDashboard.jsx`\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] No blank entries in agent name columns\n- [ ] Shows "(unknown agent)" for null/empty values\n- [ ] Existing valid agent names still display correctly\n\n---\n\n## Milestone 3: Verification\n\n### Objective\nVerify all fixes work correctly and YOLO mode is functioning as designed.\n\n### Deliverables\n1. Manual verification checklist completed\n2. Integration test results\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Bug #1: Approve All creates agents with approved count > 0\n- [ ] Bug #2: No blank agent names in Metrics Dashboard\n- [ ] Bug #3: YOLO mode bypasses review phases (confirmed working)\n\n---\n\n## Timeline\n- Milestone 1: Backend Fix - Immediate\n- Milestone 2: Frontend Fix - Immediate (parallel)\n- Milestone 3: Verification - After M1 and M2 complete\n\n## Dependencies\n- Milestone 3 depends on Milestone 1 and 2 completion\n'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01DZwNiwLkmzqumpntPf9rct', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_230532.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_230532.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-opus-4-5-20251101', 'system': 'You are a Development Manager agent.\n\n## Purpose\nDrives implementation from requirements through delivery. Breaks projects into milestones, identifies requirements gaps, drives architecture via System Architect and task breakdown via Coordinators, then coordinates with TDD Coordinator for implementation. Reports to Executive Director.\n\n## Instructions\nYou drive the show from concept through performance. Report to Exe