{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 23:05:43", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-d211d2ea-a2b0-42ab-8953-352a7d949402', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "problem_description": "Fix two bugs in the Ensemble UI:\\n\\n## Bug #1: Approve All Button Not Working\\n\\nIn `/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/main.py`, the `approve_all_pending_reviews` function (around lines 2309 and 2336) calls a method that doesn\'t exist:\\n\\n**Current (BROKEN):**\\n```python\\nswarm.update_pending_review_status(review_id, \'in_progress\')\\n```\\n\\n**Should be:**\\n```python\\nswarm.update_pending_review(review_id, status=\'in_progress\')\\n```\\n\\nAnd at lines ~2336-2339:\\n**Current (BROKEN):**\\n```python\\nswarm.update_pending_review_status(\\n    review_id,\\n    \'in_progress\',\\n    execution_result={\'agent_id\': agent_id, \'status\': result.get(\'status\')}\\n)\\n```\\n\\n**Should be:**\\n```python\\nswarm.update_pending_review(\\n    review_id,\\n    status=\'in_progress\',\\n    execution_result={\'agent_id\': agent_id, \'status\': result.get(\'status\')}\\n)\\n```\\n\\n## Bug #2: Blank Agent Name on Metrics Page\\n\\nIn `/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/MetricsDashboard.jsx`, agent names can be null/empty causing blank display.\\n\\nAt lines 137, 169, 212, and 373, change from:\\n```jsx\\n<code style={{ fontSize: \'0.85rem\' }}>{agent.agent_name}</code>\\n```\\nTo:\\n```jsx\\n<code style={{ fontSize: \'0.85rem\' }}>{agent.agent_name || \'(unknown agent)\'}</code>\\n```\\n\\nFor the error table (line 373), it uses `error.agent_name` instead of `agent.agent_name`:\\n```jsx\\