ttbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/MetricsDashboard.jsx`\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] No blank entries in agent name columns\n- [ ] Shows "(unknown agent)" for null/empty values\n- [ ] Existing valid agent names still display correctly\n\n---\n\n## Milestone 3: Verification\n\n### Objective\nVerify all fixes work correctly and YOLO mode is functioning as designed.\n\n### Deliverables\n1. Manual verification checklist completed\n2. Integration test results\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Bug #1: Approve All creates agents with approved count > 0\n- [ ] Bug #2: No blank agent names in Metrics Dashboard\n- [ ] Bug #3: YOLO mode bypasses review phases (confirmed working)\n\n---\n\n## Timeline\n- Milestone 1: Backend Fix - Immediate\n- Milestone 2: Frontend Fix - Immediate (parallel)\n- Milestone 3: Verification - After M1 and M2 complete\n\n## Dependencies\n- Milestone 3 depends on Milestone 1 and 2 completion\n'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01DZwNiwLkmzqumpntPf9rct', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_230532.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_230532.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_016HuLZv5gSJPiyS3W7KChKw', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/tdd_coordinator', 'input_data': {'problem_description': "Fix two bugs in the Ensemble UI:\n\n## Bug #1: Approve All Button Not Working\n\nIn `/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/main.py`, the `approve_all_pending_reviews` function (around lines 2309 and 2336) calls a method that doesn't exist:\n\n**Current (BROKEN):**\n```python\nswarm.update_pending_review_status(review_id, 'in_progress')\n```\n\n**Should be:**\n```python\nswarm.update_pending_review(review_id, status='in_progress')\n```\n\nAnd at lines ~2336-2339:\n**Current (BROKEN):**\n```python\nswarm.update_pending_review_status(\n    review_id,\n    'in_progress',\n    execution_result={'agent_id': agent_id, 'status': result.get('status')}\n)\n```\n\n**Should be:**\n```python\nswarm.update_pending_review(\n    review_id,\n    status='in_progress',\n    execution_result={'agent_id': agent_id, 'status': result.get('status')}\n)\n```\n\n## Bug #2: Blank Agent Name on Metrics Page\n\nIn `/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/MetricsDashboard.jsx`, agent names can be null/empty causing blank display.\n\nAt lines 137, 169, 212, and 373, change from:\n```jsx\n<code style={{ fontSize: '0.85rem' }}>{agent.agent_name}</code>\n```\nTo:\n```jsx\n<code style={{ fontSize: '0.85rem' }}>{agent.agent_name || '(unknown agent)'}</code>\n```\n\nFor the error table (line 373), it uses `error.agent_name` instead of `agent.agent_name`:\n```jsx\n<code style={{ fontSize: '0.85rem' }}>{error.agent_name || '(unknown agent)'}</code>\n```", 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui', 'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_016HuLZv5gSJPiyS3W7KChKw', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {"status": "completed", "response_type": "conversational", "message": "Now I need to identify and fix the two bugs mentioned:\\n\\n**Bug #1**: In the backend at lines ~2309 and ~2336, there are calls to `swarm.update_pending_review_status()` that should be `swarm.update_pending_review()` with keyword arguments.\\n\\n**Bug #2**: In the fronten