{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 23:08:28", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-1a2f75d3-7d9c-4f2f-87ca-5e021ece488e', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/tmux_monitoring_dashboard/architecture_m2.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "project_name": "Tmux Monitoring Dashboard"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01W5EQ6Hm7dLvXQ97mTFK4R9', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/tmux_monitoring_dashboard/architecture_m2.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01W5EQ6Hm7dLvXQ97mTFK4R9', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Tmux Monitoring Dashboard - Milestone 2 Architecture\\n\\n## A. Architecture Overview\\n\\n### Purpose\\nDevelop an intelligent task monitoring system that provides real-time, visually intuitive tracking of agent tasks within the ensemble project management workflow.\\n\\n### Architecture Pattern\\nAdopted a modular, event-driven design with separation of concerns:\\n- Data Parsing Layer: Responsible for reading and interpreting project state\\n- Display Layer: Handles formatting and rendering of task information\\n- Update Mechanism: Manages real-time synchronization\\n\\n## B. Tech Stack\\n\\n### Languages and Frameworks\\n- **Language**: Python 3.9+\\n  - Rationale: Strong typing, excellent file/JSON parsing, cross-platform compatibility\\n  - Alternatives Considered: Bash scripting (too limited), Node.js (unnecessary complexity)\\n\\n### Key Libraries\\n- `json`: Native JSON parsing\\n- `rich`: Advanced terminal formatting and color support\\n- `watchdog`: File system monitoring for real-time updates\\n- `colorama`: Cross-platform terminal color support\\n\\n## C. System Components\\n\\n### 1. Task Parser (`task_parser.py`)\\n**Responsibilities**:\\n- Read project tracking JSON from `~/.ensemble/projects/`\\n- Parse and validate task metadata\\n- Extract task status, progress, and details\\n\\n**Input**: Project JSON file\\n**Output**: Structured task data\\n\\n### 2. Display Formatter (`display_manager.py`)\\n**Responsibilities**:\\n- Convert parsed tasks to human-readable format\\n- Apply color coding and status icons\\n- Generate task summary statistics\\n\\n**Features**:\\n- Status icon mapping: \\n  - \\u2705 Completed tasks\\n  - \\u26a1 In-progress tasks\\n  - \\u23f3 Pending tasks\\n  - \\u274c Blocked tasks\\n\\n### 3. Update Watcher (`file_watcher.py`)\\n**Responsibilities**:\\n- Monitor project tracking file for changes\\n- Trigger task list refresh\\n- Handle file access errors gracefully\\n\\n## D. Data Flow Diagram\\n```\\n[Project JSON] \\u2192 [Task Parser] \\u2192 [Validation] \\u2192 [Display Formatter] \\u2192 [Terminal Display]\\n                      \\u2191                               \\u2193\\n               [File Watcher] \\u2190----------- [Periodic Refresh]\\n```\\n\\n## E. File/Directory Structure\\n```\\ntmux_monitoring_dashboard/\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 scripts/\\n\\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 monitoring/\\n\\u2502       \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 task_watcher.py        # Main script\\n\\u2502       \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 task_parser.py          # JSON parsing logic\\n\\u2502       \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 display_manager.py      # Formatting and display\\n\\u2502       \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 file_watcher.py         # Real-time update mechanism\\n\\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 requirements.txt                # Python dependencies\\n```\\n\\n## F. Error Handling Strategy\\n- Graceful handling of missing/malformed project files\\n- Configurable logging for debugging\\n- Fallback display for incomplete data\\n- Retry mechanisms for file access issues\\n\\n## G. Performance Considerations\\n- Lightweight parsing (minimal CPU usage)\\n- Efficient file watching\\n- Update interval: 1-2 seconds\\n- Minimal memory footprint\\n\\n## H. Deployment Approach\\n- Callable as standalone Python script\\n- Embeddable in tmux dashboard\\n- Cross-platform compatibility (macOS, Linux)\\n\\n## I. Testing Strategy\\n1. Unit Tests\\n   - Task parsing accuracy\\n   - Display formatting\\n   - Error handling scenarios\\n\\n2. Integration Tests\\n   - File watching reliability\\n   - Real-time update performance\\n   - Tmux integration\\n\\n## J. Open Questions / User Input Needed\\n- Preferred update interval (currently 1-2 seconds)\\n- Desired level of task detail in display\\n- Custom color scheme preferences\\n\\n## K. Risks and Mitigations\\n1. **Risk**: Inconsistent project file format\\n   **Mitigation**: Robust schema validation, default values\\n\\n2. **Risk**: Performance overhead\\n   **Mitigation**: Efficient parsing, minimal background processing\\n\\n3. **Risk**: Cross-platform compatibility\\n   **Mitigation**: Extensive testing, use of cross-platform libraries"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Kg7QBw1waeNk7bHBnUa7hU', 'name': 'run_command', 'input': {'command': 'find /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output -name "*tmux*" -type f | head -10'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Kg7QBw1waeNk7bHBnUa7hU', 'content': '{"success": true, "exit_code": 0, "stdout": "", "stderr": ""}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01N7FfQL6nSUX2msm8Hiz9kL', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'get_summary'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01N7FfQL6nSUX2msm8Hiz9kL', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "project_id required for get_summary"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01B1u7urG8enobMGasgvYenW', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# Tmux Monitoring Dashboard - Project Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\nDevelop an intelligent task monitoring system that provides real-time, visually intuitive tracking of agent tasks within the ensemble project management workflow.\n\n## Milestone Breakdown\n\n### Milestone 1: Core System Foundation\n**Objective**: Establish the fundamental task parsing and display infrastructure\n**Duration**: Initial implementation phase\n**Deliverables**:\n- Task parser module for reading project JSON files\n- Basic display formatting system\n- Error handling framework\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Successfully parse project tracking JSON files\n- Display task information in readable format\n- Handle missing/malformed files gracefully\n\n### Milestone 2: Real-time Monitoring System (CURRENT)\n**Objective**: Implement file watching and real-time updates\n**Duration**: Current milestone based on architecture document\n**Deliverables**:\n- File watching system using watchdog library\n- Real-time update mechanism\n- Display manager with rich formatting\n- Main monitoring script\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Monitor project files for changes\n- Update display within 1-2 seconds of file changes\n- Rich color-coded display with status icons\n- Cross-platform compatibility (macOS, Linux)\n\n### Milestone 3: Integration and Polish\n**Objective**: Complete tmux integration and final enhancements\n**Duration**: Final implementation phase\n**Deliverables**:\n- Tmux integration scripts\n- Configuration options\n- Documentation and deployment guides\n- Performance optimizations\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Seamless tmux dashboard integration\n- Configurable update intervals\n- Complete documentation\n- All tests passing\n\n## Dependencies\n- Python 3.9+\n- watchdog library for file monitoring\n- rich library for terminal formatting\n- colorama for cross-platform color support\n\n## Risk Assessment\n1. **Performance overhead**: Mitigated by efficient parsing and minimal background processing\n2. **Cross-platform compatibility**: Addressed through extensive testing and cross-platform libraries\n3. **File format inconsistencies**: Handled by robust schema validation\n\n## Success Metrics\n- Real-time updates within 1-2 seconds\n- Minimal CPU/memory usage\n- Zero downtime during file changes\n- Complete task visibility'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01B1u7urG8enobMGasgvYenW', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_230506.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_230506.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01EvqV9zxnMDAt6xtwxe7YaD', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'coordinators/backend_coordinator', 'input_data': {'milestone': 'Milestone 2: Real-time Monitoring System - Implement file watching and real-time updates for task monitoring', 'architecture': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/tmux_monitoring_dashboard/architecture_m2.md', 'requirements': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/tmux_monitoring_dashboard/architecture_m2.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development